	(text "= Additions (v2?)\n\n- Buck/Boost for stable 5V\n- 6V regulator for program / verify\n- Modern 12V boost\n- In-spec inrush\n\n= Voltages\n\nVCC → 5V, 6V verify\nVPP → 5V, 12V program\n A9 → >2V, 12V ID\n\n= Current\n\n∙ Max 500mA from USB\n∙ VPP → 50mA pgrm, 5mA read\n∙ VCC → 75mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.462 170.18 0)
		(effects
